# Earth King's Lieutenant: "Whenever another Ally you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Entering itself
# gives it nothing, nor does Bot1's Ornithopter (no Ally). Bot1's Invasion Reinforcements (an Ally) and the Ally token it makes
# give it two counters, 3/3; Bot2's own Invasion Reinforcements and its token, entering under the other player, give it none.

